; A fresh reading of 97.5 arrives at 08:00:20, and the arm moves one second
; later: the condition of the prohibition, read in the state of 08:00:20, is
; true, so the prohibition is breached at the movement and the monitor blocks
; it. The controller does not stop the drive by 08:00:30, so the obligation is
; breached at the deadline and escalated; the safety engineer stops the drive
; at 08:00:45, within 30 seconds of the breach, which fulfils the escalated
; obligation, while the breach of the controller stays on record. No fresh
; reading below the limit arrives by 08:10:00, but the invariant is undefined,
; not false: the reading at activation is absent, and so is the reading at
; 08:00:45, 25 seconds after its arrival.
(scenario sensor_not_stopped
  (spec "examples/core/sensor_overheat.triel")
  (entry "2026-11-09T08:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (motor_temp (dec 97.5)) (limit_c (dec 90.0))))
  (entry "2026-11-09T08:00:20Z" (arrive motor_temp)
    (data (motor_temp (dec 97.5)) (limit_c (dec 90.0))))
  (entry "2026-11-09T08:00:21Z" (act arm move must_not)
    (data (motor_temp (dec 97.5)) (limit_c (dec 90.0))))
  (entry "2026-11-09T08:00:45Z" (act safety_engineer stop_drive must)
    (data (motor_temp (dec 97.5)) (limit_c (dec 90.0))))
  (entry "2026-11-09T08:11:00Z" (tick)
    (data (motor_temp (dec 97.5)) (limit_c (dec 90.0)))))
